  "faq": [
    [
      "Can I start learning without any prior experience?",
      "Absolutely. Choose a beginner course and follow its activities in order. Clear explanations and guided practice help you build confidence, one step at a time."
    ],
    [
      "What can I learn on Skill UP?",
      "Explore computer fundamentals, programming, databases, web development, networks, cybersecurity, data science and AI."
    ],
    [
      "How long does a typical course take?",
      "Each course shows an estimated duration and deadline. You can learn at your own pace and resume where you left off."
    ],
    [
      "How do I track my progress and earn a certificate?",
      "Complete the course activities and pass its assessments. Your progress updates automatically, and a certificate becomes available when the course is complete."
    ],
    [
      "Can I get help if I have a question?",
      "Use course discussions, message your instructor, or open the learning companion for guidance."
    ]
  ],
